  "ingredients": [
    "4 slices bacon, diced",
    "1.5 cups chopped onion",
    "4 cups peeled and cubed potatoes",
    "1.5 cups water",
    "1.5 teaspoons salt",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground black pepper to taste",
    "3 cups half-and-half",
    "3 tablespoons butter",
    "2 (10 ounce) cans minced clams"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0zoySYpuepuElnWXXI15H18-L-E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13078-New-England-Clam-Chowder-DDMFS-Step-1-0528-6dee427180f9494d9bdb6e9c0c16fb0e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13078/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place diced bacon in a large stockpot over medium-high heat; cook and stir until almost crisp. Add onion; cook and stir until tender, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hfxaS2OHIbb4oCh_OVhCBmOmuic=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13078-New-England-Clam-Chowder-DDMFS-Step-3-0531-b91c916505a54121803a04ad3ccffed6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13078/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in potatoes and add water; season with salt and pepper and bring to a boil. Reduce heat to low and simmer, uncovered, until potatoes are tender, about 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Nr7wIOWhWYXwGqIp7go67XzxOo0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13078-New-England-Clam-Chowder-DDMFS-Step-5-0542-b1c9dc3123ad48d196ba5ff9761f5457.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13078/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour in half-and-half and add butter.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/KgOGZ_lC1Kc3vPcxmEANJAIfyUk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13078-New-England-Clam-Chowder-DDMFS-Step-6-0543-c8880395c16d4269975a39ce609d7019.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13078/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drain clams, reserving clam liquid; stir clams and 1/2 of the clam liquid into the soup. Cook until heated through, without boiling, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/OTXOopMVm_9Zlg56uSeA1au6ihE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13078-New-England-Clam-Chowder-DDMFS-Step-7-0545-acbbc08d93314e6982273485ed294892.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13078/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ElqwjwX_F7u9wPDB6dfHYxYmVCY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13078-New-England-Clam-Chowder-DDMFS-3X4-0560-e9b8d6db885546538990735f2d4d2199.jpg"
